OL,3,GNEWSAUnion agrees to suspend strike
OL,4,Aaction at schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FStrike action by teachers at four
OL,7,FLincolnshire schools has been
OL,8,Fsuspended.
OL,10,FThe National Education Union (NEU) said
OL,11,Fthe industrial action, which had been
OL,12,Frunning since May, was over the
OL,13,FHorncastle Education Trust not agreeing
OL,14,Fto recognise unions.
OL,16,FThe dispute involves staff at
OL,17,FBanovallum School and Queen Elizabeth's
OL,18,FGrammar School in Horncastle, New York
OL,19,Fand Frithville Primary School in
OL,20,FBoston, and Huttoft Primary School.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
