OL,3,GNEWSAUnion agrees to suspend strike
OL,4,Aaction at schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe NEU said the trust had agreed to
OL,7,Frecognise trade unions and it would
OL,8,Fhold a further ballot of its members in
OL,9,FOctober about resolving the dispute.
